"Saving power" = "省电";
"Balanced" = "均衡";
"Android only runs while an Android app is open, and adapts while it does: frugal by default, a little faster for the app in front when your Mac has power to spare." = "仅在 Android 应用打开时运行。默认省电档。本机资源充足时，前台应用使用均衡档。";
"Stays ready so apps open instantly, and adapts all the time: full speed for the app you're using, and power saving as soon as other apps need your Mac or the battery runs low." = "后台保持运行，应用可迅速打开。前台使用性能档；其他应用需要资源或电量偏低时改为省电档。";
"Android runs as it is, with nothing tuned: every processor core, all of its memory and its own power settings. Stays ready in the background." = "用满「设置」中为 Android 指定的核心和内存，不改 Android 的电源设置，后台保持就绪。";
"Maximum performance, all the time: every core and all of Android's memory, its game optimizations, up to 120 fps and lower input latency." = "用满「设置」中为 Android 指定的核心和内存，启用游戏优化。窗口最高 120 fps，输入延迟更低。";
"Right now: %@. App windows stream at up to %@ fps; windows opened from now on use it." = "当前档位：%@。应用窗口最高 %@ fps，此后新打开的窗口使用此帧率。";
"The mode applies whenever Android is running." = "Android 运行期间使用此模式。";
"Processor cores for Android" = "Android 的处理器核心";
"Memory for Android" = "Android 的内存";
"%@ GB" = "%@ GB";
"These are the most Android can use. Power Saver and Smart lend part of them back to macOS while Android runs. Changes take effect the next time Android starts." = "这是上限。省电和智能运行时，实际占用低于此上限。更改后，下次启动 Android 时生效。";
