"Android apps on your Mac: Android runs in a virtual machine with Apple's Hypervisor framework, and every Android app gets its own Mac window. Built on LineageOS, QEMU and scrcpy. An independent project, not made or endorsed by Google or the LineageOS project. Android is a trademark of Google LLC. The Android robot is reproduced or modified from work created and shared by Google and used according to terms described in the Creative Commons 3.0 Attribution License." = "在本机运行 Android 应用。Android 在虚拟机中运行，使用 Apple 的 Hypervisor，每个应用有各自的窗口。基于 LineageOS、QEMU 和 scrcpy。这是独立项目，不是 Google 或 LineageOS 项目制作的，也未获它们认可。Android 是 Google LLC 的商标。机器人形象来自 Google 创作并共享的作品，按 Creative Commons 3.0 署名许可复制或修改后使用。";
"Version, licences and acknowledgements." = "版本、许可和致谢。";

